{
  "_comment": "Single source of truth for shortcut actions, defaults and reserved combinations. Read by the renderer (src/shared/shortcuts.ts) and by Rust (src-tauri/src/storage/shortcuts.rs). `Mod` = Ctrl on Windows/Linux and Cmd on macOS.",
